The entire clientData "list" is a reactive values object. Currently it doesn't look to me like the url_search will change, but that might be considered a bug--it's possible to manipulate the URL without the page reloading using JavaScript (see https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/History_API) but it doesn't result in changes to url_search right now AFAICT.

